          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, waan atini hayyu Tirotini jettu, Atini ufi guddifte, kiyyibde keesa dabarte, waaqa ufiini jette. Ammalle atini, Anini waaqa ka barch'uma guddinna ira jiddu baariini tau jetta. Ato waaqa ufi tolchitele atini waaqaniti, namuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini waan Danieli ira qaro ufi seeta waan wonti tokoleeni dandeete si duraa d'okhatu inseetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaroomafi beekhi kanke worqifi qarsiini si duroomse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini daldala keesa jabaatte, akasiini guddo woi horatte, duuba hori sunini kiyyibde!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba amma wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: waan atini qaro aka Waaqa ufi seetufi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anini nyaapa naasu inqamne si haasise, worri hori kanke dansa ka atini beekhafi qaroomani horatte siraa balleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri si ijeese boola bisaani keesati si awaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo worri si ijeesu d'ufu, atini hojja sunile Waaquma ufiini jetta? Atini Waaqaniti, namuma, yo si ijeesu d'ufani inuma doota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini akuma sare harka worra Waaqa imbeennetini doota. Nami waan kana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka hayyu Tiro balleesani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, dira Tiro faarsi bohi waan jettuuni AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'u, Atini duri nama d'ugaa qajeela, ka nama ch'ufaa akheekha dansaa tae. Ee, atini akami qaro, ammalle akami mid'aada! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini oobru Waaqa ta Edeni keesa qubatte, faaya ch'uch'uluqa gosa heddu naqate: d'akha diima, d'akha adi ch'ulkicha, d'akha baricha, d'akha doti, ch'abbi ch'ululut'u d'akha ch'ulkicha, d'akha bule ch'ulkicha aka dulo dooqa, d'akha doti, d'akha diima d'iiga. Atini ammalle faaya worqi inqabda faaya kana ch'ufa, gaafa si uumani, sii mid'aasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini malaika nama mudamsiiftu ta si eeddu d'aatu te kaye. Atini gaara kiyya qulqullo gubbaa qubatte, d'akhaye ch'uch'ulut'u ira deemte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga si uumani asi, haga ch'ubbuuni si inqabatini, adabi kanke dansa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini guddo daldalte duuba wonti sunini had'iisafi ch'ubbu keesa si buufte. Tanaafi anini gaara kiyya qulqullo iraa si had'e, malaikaani si eeddu taanileeni d'akhaye ch'uch'ulut'u taani biraa si gussite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini mid'aguma tanteetiini ufi koorsite, guddinni kanke mata si d'owe si daallese. Maro waan kanatifi anini darbaad'e lafa si buuse, aka hayyooti d'ibiini yo waan si tolchani kana gartu sodaatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini daldala kara dabatini tolchite, akanaani fulla Waaqa iti kad'atule t'ureesite. Tanaafi anini amma dira kanke ibida iti kaye gube balleesa. Nami amma d'ufe si laalu daara male woma inargu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini yayu badde! Deebiani si inargani, ammalle gochiti ch'ufti ta fuula si beetuleeni rifate, waan wonti sunini worra qabatu seete mudamti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waan Sidoni ka fagani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
