        },
        {
          "text": "ABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, dira Sidoni abaari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jettuuni, wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Ee Sidoni, anini yayu nyaapa siti tae, biyyitileeni waan anini si tolchu kana gula na faarsiti. Ammalle hojja anini nama si keesa tau gaargalchu qulqullooma tiyya argani, akanaani aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini d'ukuba siti erge, kara kanke ch'ufa keesati d'iiga lolaasa. Gama ch'ufa si had'ani, nama kanke ch'ufa fit'ani, duuba akanaani aka anini AABBO Waaqa beeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worra Israeliti eebisani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
